<https://w3id.org/revmeta/facet/usesSynthesisMethod> skos:scopeNote "Explicit label plus substantive realization is sufficient; label alone is not. Nested synthesis methods may coexist. Local framework use, presentation style, and extraction are not independent synthesis methods."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Ordinary interpretation or critique is insufficient unless a structured argument/position is claimed as principal contribution."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2079"^^xsd:integer .
