<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "May overlap with PositionFunction but requires an independent contribution claim."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2080"^^xsd:integer .
