<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "Gate 1 — principal claim: central text explicitly presents a structured thesis, critique, position, or argument as a principal contribution/value added by the publication."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
