<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/codeWhen/002> rdf:value "Gate 2 — type fit: the claimed contribution advances and supports a reasoned position/critique derived from the synthesis rather than merely interpreting results."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.ArgumentativeContribution/codeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
