<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "Gate 1 — principal claim: central text explicitly presents a framework as a principal contribution/value added by the publication."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1927"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/002> rdf:value "Gate 2 — type fit: the claimed contribution organizes components/concepts/stages/relations/rules for analysis, design, evaluation, or understanding."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
