<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/003> rdf:value "Gate 3 — realization: the claimed contribution is materially developed in the publication rather than merely promised, mentioned, or implied by an artifact."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/codeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "1929"^^xsd:integer .
