<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not code solely because authors call a classification scheme a framework; if it only partitions phenomena into categories/dimensions, assess TaxonomyContribution."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.FrameworkContribution/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
