<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAnalyticalObjectType.Algorithm/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "The preferred label remains Algorithm for vocabulary stability, but operational scope includes materially analyzed computational/technical technique families. This is a label clarification, not a new class."@en .
