<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasEvidenceSourceRole.MethodologicalGuidanceSource/positiveExample/002> rdf:value "A review analyzes methodological papers and guidance documents about automation or evidence-synthesis methods as evidence units."@en .
