<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasEvidenceSourceRole.PracticeBasedSource/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "Institutional, organizational, government, professional or practitioner-origin sources contribute substantive operational/practice/policy evidence or data used in synthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasEvidenceSourceRole.PracticeBasedSource/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
