<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasEvidenceSourceRole.PracticeBasedSource/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasEvidenceSourceRole.PracticeBasedSource/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "521"^^xsd:integer .
