<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasExecutionMode.RapidExecutionMode/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "If no positive rapid modifier is reported after relevant sections are checked, record no positive assertion rather than treating ordinary review as a separate value."@en .
