<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Require at least two defensibly distinct layers and an explicit relation between them as an object of synthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2317"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "Multiple taxonomy axes, train/test phases, components, or perspectives alone are insufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2318"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/003> rdf:value "Because “layer” remains under-specified across domains, retain REVIEW status pending revalidation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/boundaryNote/003> revmeta:sourceLine "2319"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "Research-only Gate 1 — the review explicitly defines or operationally distinguishes at least two levels/layers that differ in scope, function, or abstraction and are treated as levels rather than merely categories."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2307"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/002> rdf:value "Research-only Gate 2 — relations between those layers (e.g. dependency, interface, propagation, feedback, trade-off, co-design) are themselves material synthesis targets."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2308"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/003> rdf:value "Both gates must be supported; borderline cases remain ambiguous in FULL_SEMANTIC_AUDIT."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/codeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "2309"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not code mere coverage of multiple axes, components, perspectives, phases, modules, or taxonomy dimensions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2312"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not code when the paper discusses several levels but does not synthesize relationships between them."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2313"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/003> rdf:value "Do not use in CORE_ONLY or CORE_PLUS_OPTIONAL production annotation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/doNotCodeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "2314"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "A taxonomy has two axes or a method has train/test phases, but relationships between distinct layers are not themselves synthesized."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2325"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The synthesis explicitly links architecture-level, evaluation-level, and governance-level phenomena and analyzes dependencies/trade-offs among those defined layers."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasOrganizingLens.CrossLayerLens/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2322"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasPublicationFunction.AgendaSettingFunction/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasPublicationFunction.AgendaSettingFunction/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "A substantial dedicated Challenges/Future Directions section can establish function; principality is materiality-based, not restricted to being the sole objective."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasPublicationFunction.AgendaSettingFunction/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasPublicationFunction.AgendaSettingFunction/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "405"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasPublicationFunction.AgendaSettingFunction/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasPublicationFunction.AgendaSettingFunction/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "A paper-level cue or substantial dedicated section organizes multiple future research directions/questions/challenges/priorities as a material function."@en .
