<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematicReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The authors identify the publication as a systematic review and report structured database/search procedures plus explicit eligibility screening/selection of the evidence set."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematicReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematicReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "121"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "SystematizedReviewDesign is a declared design family, not a quality grade."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "229"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "A single design claim should not be normalized simultaneously to SystematicReviewDesign and SystematizedReviewDesign; co-coding would require distinct independently reported design components."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "230"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The publication explicitly self-identifies the design as systematized/systematised/semi-systematic review, OR explicitly states that it intentionally applies substantial systematic-review elements while presenting the design as partial/semi-systematic rather than a full systematic review."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "221"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/002> rdf:value "The declared partial/systematized design is reflected in the described review procedure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/codeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "222"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not use as a fallback label for a systematic review that is incompletely reported, methodologically weak, or judged noncompliant."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "225"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not infer solely from use of some systematic-search/screening practices without an explicit partial/systematized design cue."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "226"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "A paper is missing several PRISMA items, but the authors still explicitly claim a systematic review; incompleteness alone does not make it systematized."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "236"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The methods explicitly describe a semi-systematic review that applies a structured search and screening process without claiming a full systematic review."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.SystematizedReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "233"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Existing reviews must be the principal evidence units; citations to prior reviews are insufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "206"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "Do not automatically add ExistingReview analytical object unless prior reviews are directly analyzed as objects under that property test."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "207"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The publication explicitly identifies an umbrella review/overview of reviews, or the design clearly appraises and synthesizes existing reviews as the main corpus."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "199"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not code merely because some reviews are cited."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "202"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not add automatically to every meta-narrative review of reviews unless the umbrella role is independently supported."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "203"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "The publication never declares or substantively supports an umbrella review design; a superficially similar output or writing style is the only cue."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "213"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The authors explicitly state that the review was conducted as an umbrella review design, and the methods are compatible with that declared design."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasReviewDesign.UmbrellaReviewDesign/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "210"^^xsd:integer .
