<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.BenchmarkArtifact/codeWhen/003> rdf:value "Gate 3 — type fit: The product is a reusable benchmark, evaluation suite, benchmarking protocol, or reference resource intended to standardize comparative evaluation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.BenchmarkArtifact/codeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
