<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.FrameworkArtifact/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The current review produces a bounded organizing structure with dimensions/components/stages/relations/rules that can guide analysis, design, evaluation, implementation or understanding."@en .
