<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchAgenda/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchAgenda/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The review produces a named or otherwise discrete research agenda that can be independently identified and reused/referred to."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchAgenda/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchAgenda/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2265"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Ordinary supplementary files are insufficient unless they constitute a discrete reusable research resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2242"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The current review releases or produces a stably identifiable reusable repository, dataset, codebase, tool, registry or structured collection. A named public repository is sufficient evidence of identity when explicitly tied to review artifacts."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2235"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not require exhaustive in-paper inventory of every repository file once release and identity are explicit."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2238"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Ordinary supplementary files without reusable research-resource identity remain insufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2239"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "An ordinary table, figure, or discussion passage resembles a research resource but has no discrete artifact identity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2248"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The review produces a named or otherwise discrete research resource that can be independently identified and reused/referred to."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.ResearchResource/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2245"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Classification-only structures are TaxonomyArtifact even when authors call them frameworks. Multi-type FrameworkArtifact only if additional organizing relations/rules/stages are genuinely present."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2133"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "Gate 1 — production: the artifact is generated by the current review rather than merely analyzed from prior literature."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2123"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/002> rdf:value "Gate 2 — discrete identity: the output passes the DISCRETE_ARTIFACT test and can be identified as a bounded scholarly product even if embedded in the article."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2124"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/003> rdf:value "Gate 3 — type fit: The product classifies domain entities/concepts into explicit categories using meaningful distinctions, dimensions, or assignment principles; a mere labeled list/table is insufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/codeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "2125"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Ordinary result tables, figures, lists, analysis steps, generic recommendations, or supplementary files without independent scholarly-product identity are insufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2128"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not infer a claimsContributionType value automatically from artifact presence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "2129"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/003> rdf:value "Do not multi-type the same product unless it independently satisfies every asserted artifact definition."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/doNotCodeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "2130"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "An ordinary table, figure, or discussion passage resembles a taxonomy artifact but has no discrete artifact identity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2139"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The review produces a named or otherwise discrete taxonomy artifact that can be independently identified and reused/referred to."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/producesOutputArtifact.TaxonomyArtifact/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "2136"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Routine publication-year counts alone are insufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1639"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "BibliographicMetadata analytical object may be positive even when the synthesis method is only descriptive mapping rather than bibliometric/network synthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1640"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The review performs bibliometric/network analysis as a substantive synthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1633"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Publication-year counts alone do not necessarily establish network/bibliometric synthesis unless used as a substantive bibliometric analysis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1636"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "The paper uses a presentation or analysis element resembling bibliometric/network synthesis, but it does not perform substantive cross-source synthesis by that method."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1646"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The methods/results show bibliometric/network synthesis being used to integrate evidence across multiple included sources."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.BibliometricNetworkSynthesis/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1643"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "All three mapping-synthesis gates are required: structure, corpus-wide application, and interpretive synthesis use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1489"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "In v0.2.3 a code=1 decision is invalid unless structured dms_gate_checks provide evidence for all three gates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1490"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/003> rdf:value "A produced EvidenceMap artifact and DescriptiveMappingSynthesis are independent decisions; either can occur without the other."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/boundaryNote/003> revmeta:sourceLine "1491"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "Gate 1 — mapping structure: the review defines or derives explicit categories, dimensions, cells, or comparable variables for mapping the evidence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1479"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/002> rdf:value "Gate 2 — corpus application: included evidence is systematically assigned/aggregated across that mapping structure at corpus level, rather than shown only illustratively."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1480"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/003> rdf:value "Gate 3 — synthesis use: the mapped distributions, concentrations, gaps, patterns, or cross-category relations are interpreted as substantive synthesis results."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/codeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "1481"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not code a taxonomy, table, matrix, or evidence-map display that merely organizes/presents extracted information without a substantive corpus-level mapping synthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1484"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not infer from the publication calling itself a survey/mapping paper unless the three mapping-synthesis gates are met."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1485"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/003> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/003> rdf:value "If structured organization exists but it is unclear whether the mapping operation itself constitutes synthesis, use ambiguous rather than forcing a positive value."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/003> revmeta:itemIndex "3"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/003> revmeta:sourceLine "1486"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "A taxonomy or table displays extracted categories but no corpus-wide assignment/distribution is synthesized."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1498"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/002> rdf:value "A few publication-year counts are shown without systematic mapping and interpretive use."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/negativeExample/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1499"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "A review assigns all included sources to defined categories, reports category frequencies/distributions, and interprets concentrations/gaps."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1494"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/002> rdf:value "A review maps all guidance documents across process stages/topic areas and interprets which areas are covered or missing."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.DescriptiveMappingSynthesis/positiveExample/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1495"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "A priori framework-based coding across evidence qualifies even when paired with thematic analysis; local framework reference does not."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1536"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The review explicitly uses framework synthesis with substantive cross-source realization; OR evidence across the corpus/subcorpus is systematically coded/organized through a defined analytical framework."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1529"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not infer from producing/displaying a framework."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1532"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not code a one-off/local comparison of findings to a standard/framework when the main synthesis is another method and the framework is not a systematic synthesis structure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.FrameworkSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
