<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Do not infer from generic discussion of context and mechanisms."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1615"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "The paper uses a presentation or analysis element resembling realist synthesis, but it does not perform substantive cross-source synthesis by that method."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1625"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The methods/results show realist synthesis being used to integrate evidence across multiple included sources."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/positiveExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.RealistSynthesis/positiveExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1622"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> rdf:value "Require theme development/synthesis across textual evidence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1514"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> rdf:value "Do not silently normalize generic content analysis or open/axial coding into thematic synthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/boundaryNote/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1515"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/codeWhen/001> rdf:value "The source explicitly uses thematic synthesis/analysis as the synthesis procedure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/codeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1507"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> rdf:value "Open/axial/grounded coding is not automatically ThematicSynthesis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1510"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> rdf:value "Do not infer from results being organized under headings/themes without a thematic method."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:itemIndex "2"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/doNotCodeWhen/002> revmeta:sourceLine "1511"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/negativeExample/001> rdf:value "The paper uses a presentation or analysis element resembling thematic synthesis, but it does not perform substantive cross-source synthesis by that method."@en .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:itemIndex "1"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/negativeExample/001> revmeta:sourceLine "1521"^^xsd:integer .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:type revmeta:CodingGuidanceItem .
<https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/usesSynthesisMethod.ThematicSynthesis/positiveExample/001> rdf:value "The methods/results show thematic synthesis being used to integrate evidence across multiple included sources."@en .
