revmeta:usesSynthesisMethod.NarrativeSynthesis skos:definition "A substantive synthesis method that integrates evidence across sources through a deliberate narrative procedure. An explicit narrative-synthesis statement plus a described cross-source organization/integration step is sufficient; narrative prose alone is not."@en .
