revmeta:usesSynthesisMethod.NarrativeSynthesis skos:notation "revmeta:usesSynthesisMethod.NarrativeSynthesis" .
revmeta:usesSynthesisMethod.NarrativeSynthesis skos:prefLabel "Narrative synthesis"@en .
